              "newText": "12.4 During the term and for twelve months after the end of a person's involvement in the Services, neither party will solicit for employment any personnel of the other party who were directly involved in performing or receiving the Services. Nothing in this Section restricts either party from (a) hiring or engaging any person who responds to a general advertisement or other recruitment effort not specifically targeted at the other party's personnel, or (b) hiring or engaging any person who approaches it on an unsolicited basis, and neither party is subject to any no-hire obligation."
